Z||000001||StuGood||08-28-2001||01:17 AM||||...ordinarily on the Muncie 4-speed, you have to pull the VSS (vehicle speed sensor/ speedometer sending unit) to check transaxle fluid level.  Might be you have something other than the original-equipment transaxle?  ||||reg||5
